#: manifest.ini:changelog
msgid ""
"Version 1.0:\n"
"- Improved reading responsiveness for medium and long text with faster starts, smoother audio buffering, and reuse of completed audio held temporarily in RAM.\n"
"- Improved multilingual sentence and phrase breaks and the Use automatic language profiles feature using official Unicode 17.0 and CLDR 48.2 data.\n"
"- Increased default speech loudness and kept volume steadier without abnormal rises and falls. The Volume setting remains proportional. Distortion in some male voices comes from the original WASM TTS engine and is not addressed by this change.\n"
"- Improved recovery from failures in the Chromium browser runtime, WASM TTS engine, and NVDA audio output; prevented Keep Google TTS browser runtime ready in the background from retaining unhealthy runtimes; and reduced conflicts with other add-ons.\n"
"- Updated the bundled WASM TTS engine to version 20260806.1.\n"
"- Updated translations to match version 1.0."
msgstr ""
"版本 1.0：\n"
"- 改进了中长文本的阅读响应能力，具有更快的启动速度、更流畅的音频缓冲以及重复使用临时保存在 RAM 中的完整音频。\n"
"- 改进了多语言句子和短语中断以及使用官方 Unicode 17.0 和 CLDR 48.2 数据的使用自动语言配置文件功能。\n"
"- 增加了默认语音响度并保持音量稳定，没有异常的上升和下降。音量设置保持成比例。一些男声的失真来自原始 WASM TTS 引擎，此更改并未解决。\n"
"- 改进了 Chromium 浏览器运行时、WASM TTS 引擎和 NVDA 音频输出中的故障恢复；防止让 Google TTS 浏览器运行时在后台保持就绪状态，避免保留不健康的运行时；并减少与其他附加组件的冲突。\n"
"- 将捆绑的 WASM TTS 引擎更新至版本 20260806.1。\n"
"- 更新翻译以匹配版本 1.0。"
